| base→nsai_uq | 30 | 0 | 1.863e-09 | 1.304e-08 |
| base→sym | 30 | 0 | 1.863e-09 | 1.304e-08 |
| base→uq | 0 | 30 | 1.863e-09 | 1.304e-08 |
